# The repo kept LF in the index, but core.autocrlf checked files out as CRLF -
# and prettier expects LF by default. The effect: `npm run lint` reported
# "Delete ␍" in every file in the project, whatever was actually in it.
# The line below forces LF in the working tree too, on every system.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries - never touch line endings.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.webp  binary
*.svg   text eol=lf
*.ico   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
